            <a class="site-menu-link" href="https://www.gymfusion.com.au/our-services"><span class="site-menu-link__label">Our Services</span></a>
            <a class="site-menu-link" href="https://www.gymfusion.com.au/privacy-policy"><span class="site-menu-link__label">Privacy Policy</span></a>
            <a class="site-menu-link" href="https://www.gymfusion.com.au/accessibility-inclusion-statement"><span class="site-menu-link__label">Accessibility &amp; Inclusion</span></a>
            <a class="site-menu-link" href="https://www.gymfusion.com.au/our-policies"><span class="site-menu-link__label">Our Policies</span></a>
            <a class="site-menu-link" href="https://www.gymfusion.com.au/terms-and-conditions"><span class="site-menu-link__label">T&amp;Cs</span></a>
